<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12936" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-κρεμάννῡμι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κρεμάσω,</span>
		
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κρεμῶ</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>let hang down,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐχέν᾽ ἀπεκρέμασεν,</span> of a dying
			bird, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.879
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορδὰν πλῆκτρον
			ἀπεκρέμασε</span> the plectrum <i>broke</i> the string <i>so
				that it hung down,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.584
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ προβολὴ τῶν χειρῶν ἀ. τὸ σῶμα</span>”
				<i>renders unsteady,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Gym.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχύν</span>
			<i>relax,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				53
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>hang down,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				948b4
			</span></i>; <i>break forth from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηγὰς -υμένας τῶν ὀρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					6.26
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>become detached,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμη μὴ-ύσθω οὗ ζντεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>VS</u>
					2.9.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐσίαι ἀποκεκρεμασμέναι τῶν οἰκείων
					ἑνάδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					213
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hang up, suspend,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν φαρετρεῶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.216
				</span></i>
			.</div>
